WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.420
- Hey everyone, this is Luka Negoita,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.710
and I am super stoked to
be announcing the launch

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.797
of my new course on

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.971
"Data visualization
with R for Ecologists".

00:00:08.971 --> 00:00:11.638
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.590
If you know about my last course

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.940
about the basics of R for ecologists,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.260
then this course builds up

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:24.550
from there, going into
more advanced topics,

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.220
such as ggplot2! and
other really cool features

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.050
for plotting in R and RStudio.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.220
This course will be launching
on Sunday, May 30th.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.890
That's in less than two weeks.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.940
And I can't tell you how excited I am

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.980
to finally have this out and ready.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.340
If you've already pre-registered

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.170
for this course, then fantastic.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.290
If you haven't don't worry,

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.290
there's still time.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.360
Make sure to go to the link below,

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.810
enter your email address,

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.910
and you'll be sure to receive more updates

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.560
as we get closer to launch day,

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.600
including some special bonuses.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.480
I'm really excited to
be sharing this with you

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.380
and look forward to seeing you there.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.963
(upbeat music)

